      {
        "name": "places/ChIJTSBtBBEBBDQR8okXnYV4_HY/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25aWE1VaExlRlp4TjBsdVpWUTBkMDF5WDBVemNsRRAB",
        "relativePublishTimeDescription": "1 個月前",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": {
          "text": "環境裝修燈光有氛圍，一半係Barber shop，一半係酒吧，所有barber都好有經驗好nice，如果想剪頭髮或者修鬚，可以搵Chris，已經跟咗佢7年，技術非常之好，每次都好滿意👍🏼\n\nThe place has a great atmosphere with awesome decor and lighting—half barber shop, half bar. All the barbers are super experienced and friendly. If you need a haircut or a beard trim, ask for Chris. I've been going to him for 7 years now; his technique is top-notch, and I always leave completely satisfied. 👍🏼",
          "languageCode": "zh-Hant"
        },
        "originalText": {
